{"title":"Career Roadmap · Food Microbiologist","role":"Food Microbiologist","summary":"A Food Microbiologist studies, tests and controls microorganisms associated with food, beverages and food-processing environments. The role focuses on food safety, spoilage, contamination control, hygiene, shelf life and microbiological quality.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science - General / Honours)","Course":"Microbiology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Food Microbiologist studies, tests and controls microorganisms associated with food, beverages and food-processing environments. The role focuses on food safety, spoilage, contamination control, hygiene, shelf life and microbiological quality."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microbial testing of raw materials and finished products"},{"text":"Pathogen detection"},{"text":"Total microbial counts"},{"text":"Environmental and hygiene monitoring"},{"text":"Water testing"},{"text":"Food spoilage investigations"},{"text":"Shelf-life studies"},{"text":"Sampling and sample preparation"},{"text":"Food safety documentation"},{"text":"HACCP and GMP implementation"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Microbial identification"},{"text":"Quality-control support"},{"text":"Supplier and process-quality evaluation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Microbiology","Food Microbiology","Microbial Testing","Food Safety","HACCP","GMP/GLP","Environmental Monitoring","Quality Documentation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Microbiology","Microbiology + Biochemistry + Food Science","Food Microbiology Fundamentals","Microbial Culture + Enumeration","Food Pathogens + Spoilage Microorganisms","Food Sampling + Testing","HACCP + GMP + Food Safety Systems","Environmental + Hygien